<description>&lt;p&gt;A new federal judge has taken over the Maduro drug-trafficking case as Maduro returns to court to face torture allegations, while a soldier who allegedly wagered $400,000 on Maduro's removal has been arrested and another is under investigation for insider trading on Polymarket. Explosive attacks near the Colombia-Venezuela border injured police officers and civilians in two separate blasts. AI tools are under scrutiny after Trump’s Grok chatbot was reportedly used in planning a Venezuela operation. According to UCDP, there were 2 battle-related deaths in 2007.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxOeTBNZmo2b0pVVThZWWc5N3c5eFFvWkpIV25SZzRPdDAyaUExeTRsb3dhMUxKRHVTUFdsazhsRVVYWTYxZkpjVU5mTEgxQXl4NUN4OXVwcFF3OEZtQ2NYZ0N1VlExTGw5TDZuR0ZTMkFOeHNnTk0zcjh3azhLbDFLeFZLQ2swVXRXUFRBN29YUjdDaHhENHBCUEhtblBid1JRVEE1VFJVaUkzZzR4bFRZSUJVU1NBWERycUxYUmNiTVljUDc0Wnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVEFVX3lxTE1ibW5MaGE0WDF5Z285T2FPTWlnUXp3bVVmQktJY0VMZ2dkMDd5eGF4UVRVNkdIb3RLR2RURm0yRF9fWmZBWndJZXduMmlCZkk2S0k0aw?oc=5&quot;&gt;AzerNews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPOTYxU2EwNmR0V29ENUpaZDl5d2hCQ3ZYOFFodzNLMFpINm5iMU5zQ0ZWSnl6QjZ5YmtXcjhpbm9qZF9TYi1NOHgwUmNfNlZlLTlJNGtDbUJXUmxOempBUEVZckw3cjZ1UzhSSHZTUV85VXVDd3ltckljZnBuYTJneHAweGNNNnVmNjdLZlYzajJ0WnhJMjRkTnBrbVRXOXoyUW1uY0twcUpWUVFLUThoVHlHdnZYYWg0UzdBRElxWEdYQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNWUpnRDJCdDRuT3lha2xTZHVIbDNGTU5ZQnJ0UlFwQkZKeWFpeHZRYTlBdlY2aENmdW1iX2gyVkM2M2hueUlhTEh4OG01cGZmcjdQMmNIUFM5MXdNWXh5Qm5DQnZSdy1aMG5QOTN3cDlVcm9jVFlxMDVJNGNPT29nWnJaVGp6ejRzTGtESHA1MThmUjhWMEhJS3BtY21kcW1ZSnpwdUh4Vm9Hd1k?oc=5&quot;&gt;RadarOnline&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href